        <body>
            <div xml:id="d279">

                <pb facs="0509" n="405" xml:id="pg405"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.91262/124: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in Germany (Dodd)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-08-21T17:00:00-04:00">August 21, 1933—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>102. Department’s No. 99, August 19, 1 p.m. Representative <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chicago Daily News</hi> informs me Mowrer is leaving
                    Berlin tomorrow. <hi rendition="#italic">Daily News</hi> expresses concern for
                    Mowrer’s personal safety through Germany and also for that of his wife and
                    children remaining for the present in Berlin. Fears are also expressed in
                    connection with his property.</p>
                <p>Please exercise your own judgment and take whatever steps seem to be
                    desirable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
